{"Content":"{\"exit_code\": 1, \"stdout\": \"========================================\\r\\nCMeans Fuzzy Clustering Analysis\\r\\n========================================\\r\\n\\r\\nHelper scripts sourced successfully.\\r\\n\\r\\nReading input data...\\r\\n Expression matrix: 2059 metabolites x 18 samples\\r\\n Metabolite annotation: 2172 features\\r\\n Common IDs: 2059\\r\\n After intersection: 2059 metabolites\\r\\n Sample groups:\\r\\n\\r\\nNC CD FE \\r\\n 6  6  6 \\r\\n\\r\\nRow-wise z-score normalization...\\r\\n Final matrix: 2059 metabolites x 18 samples\\r\\n\\r\\n========================================\\r\\nSTEP1: Optimal Cluster Number Determination\\r\\n========================================\\r\\nEvaluating k = 2 to 15 ...\\r\\n k= 2 FPC=0.5864 PE=0.6017 Silhouette=0.2902\\r\\n k= 3 FPC=0.4766 PE=0.8844 Silhouette=0.2769\\r\\n k= 4 FPC=0.3894 PE=1.1319 Silhouette=0.2738\\r\\n k= 5 FPC=0.3292 PE=1.3411 Silhouette=0.2743\\r\\n k= 6 FPC=0.2870 PE=1.5178 Silhouette=0.2733\\r\\n k= 7 FPC=0.2560 PE=1.6694 Silhouette=0.2727\\r\\n k= 8 FPC=0.2324 PE=1.8017 Silhouette=0.1901\\r\\n k= 9 FPC=0.2137 PE=1.9192 Silhouette=0.1518\\r\\n k=10 FPC=0.1983 PE=2.0248 Silhouette=0.1411\\r\\n k=11 FPC=0.1855 PE=2.1209 Silhouette=0.1930\\r\\n k=12 FPC=0.1498 PE=2.2104 Silhouette=0.0789\\r\\n k=13 FPC=0.1623 PE=2.2317 Silhouette=0.0307\\r\\n k=14 FPC=0.1578 PE=2.2984 Silhouette=0.0547\\r\\n k=15 FPC=0.1593 PE=2.3345 Silhouette=0.1153\\r\\n\\r\\n Elbow k = 6\\r\\n Silhouette-best k = 3\\r\\n Final optimal k = 6\\r\\n Validation metrics plot saved.\\r\\n\\r\\n========================================\\r\\nSTEP2: CMeans Fuzzy Clustering (k = 6 )\\r\\n========================================\\r\\n Cluster sizes:\\r\\ncluster_labels\\r\\n  1   3   4   5 \\r\\n496 455 524 584 \\r\\n CMeans result saved to cmeans_result.rds\\r\\n Generating expression profile plots...\\r\\n\\r\\n\", \"stderr\": \"Warning message:\\r\\npackage 'e1071' was built under R version 4.5.2 \\r\\n\\r\\nAttaching package: 'ggplot2'\\r\\n\\r\\nThe following object is masked from 'package:e1071':\\r\\n\\r\\n    element\\r\\n\\r\\nWarning message:\\r\\npackage 'ggplot2' was built under R version 4.5.3 \\r\\nWarning message:\\r\\npackage 'reshape2' was built under R version 4.5.2 \\r\\nWarning message:\\r\\npackage 'gridExtra' was built under R version 4.5.3 \\r\\nWarning message:\\r\\npackage 'cluster' was built under R version 4.5.2 \\r\\nError in `geom_line()`:\\r\\n! Problem while setting up geom.\\r\\nℹ Error occurred in the 2nd layer.\\r\\nCaused by error in `compute_geom_1()`:\\r\\n! `geom_line()` requires the following missing aesthetics: x and y.\\r\\nBacktrace:\\r\\n     ▆\\r\\n  1. └─gridExtra::marrangeGrob(...)\\r\\n  2.   ├─base::do.call(arrangeGrob, c(list(grobs = groups[[g]]), params))\\r\\n  3.   └─gridExtra (local) `<fn>`(grobs = `<list>`, layout_matrix = `<int[,3]>`)\\r\\n  4.     └─base::lapply(grobs[toconv], ggplot2::ggplotGrob)\\r\\n  5.       └─ggplot2 (local) FUN(X[[i]], ...)\\r\\n  6.         ├─ggplot2::ggplot_gtable(ggplot_build(x))\\r\\n  7.         │ └─ggplot2:::attach_plot_env(data@plot@plot_env)\\r\\n  8.         │   └─base::options(ggplot2_plot_env = env)\\r\\n  9.         ├─ggplot2::ggplot_build(x)\\r\\n 10.         └─ggplot2 (local) `ggplot_build.ggplot2::ggplot`(x)\\r\\n 11.           └─ggplot2:::by_layer(...)\\r\\n 12.             ├─rlang::try_fetch(...)\\r\\n 13.             │ ├─base::tryCatch(...)\\r\\n 14.             │ │ └─base (local) tryCatchList(expr, classes, parentenv, handlers)\\r\\n 15.             │ │   └─base (local) tryCatchOne(expr, names, parentenv, handlers[[1L]])\\r\\n 16.             │ │     └─base (local) doTryCatch(return(expr), name, parentenv, handler)\\r\\n 17.             │ └─base::withCallingHandlers(...)\\r\\n 18.             └─ggplot2 (local) f(l = layers[[i]], d = data[[i]])\\r\\n 19.               └─l$compute_geom_1(d)\\r\\n 20.                 └─ggplot2 (local) compute_geom_1(..., self = self)\\r\\n 21.                   └─ggplot2:::check_required_aesthetics(...)\\r\\n 22.                     └─cli::cli_abort(...)\\r\\n 23.                       └─rlang::abort(...)\\r\\nWarning message:\\r\\nIn geom_line(data = pk_center, aes(group = 1), color = \\\"black\\\",  :\\r\\n  All aesthetics have length 1, but the data has 18 rows.\\r\\nℹ Please consider using `annotate()` or provide this layer with data containing\\r\\n  a single row.\\r\\nExecution halted\\r\\n\\r\\n\"}","Role":"tool","ToolCallId":"call_00_ET_kw65IyzkyApSXw035szZ8647","ToolCalls":null}
{"Content":"Good progress - the k selection works (k=6)! Two issues to fix:\n1. Non-sequential cluster labels (missing clusters2 &6) - need to renumber2. `geom_line` with `inherit.aes = FALSE` missing x\/y aesthetics","Role":"assistant","ToolCallId":null,"ToolCalls":[{"DeepSeekDSMLLeak":false,"FunctionArguments":{"content":"# =============================================================================\n# Script : run_cmeans.R\n# Module :7. CMeans Fuzzy Clustering Analysis\n# =============================================================================\n\ncat(\"========================================\\n\")\ncat(\"CMeans Fuzzy Clustering Analysis\\n\")\ncat(\"========================================\\n\\n\")\n\nwork_dir <- \"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\"\nfig_dir <- \"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/analysis\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\/figures\"\nrscript_dir <- \"G:\/OmicsWorks\/agent\/rscript\"\n\ndir.create(work_dir, showWarnings = FALSE, recursive = TRUE)\ndir.create(fig_dir, showWarnings = FALSE, recursive = TRUE)\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n#1. Install & load packages\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nrequired_cran <- c(\"e1071\", \"ggplot2\", \"reshape2\", \"RColorBrewer\", \n \"gridExtra\", \"pheatmap\", \"cluster\")\n\nfor (pkg in required_cran) {\n if (!requireNamespace(pkg, quietly = TRUE))\n install.packages(pkg, repos = \"https:\/\/cloud.r-project.org\", quiet = TRUE)\n}\nif (!requireNamespace(\"ComplexHeatmap\", quietly = TRUE)) {\n if (!requireNamespace(\"BiocManager\", quietly = TRUE))\n install.packages(\"BiocManager\", repos = \"https:\/\/cloud.r-project.org\")\n BiocManager::install(\"ComplexHeatmap\", ask = FALSE, update = FALSE)\n}\n\nlibrary(e1071); library(ggplot2); library(reshape2); library(RColorBrewer)\nlibrary(gridExtra); library(pheatmap); library(cluster)\nsuppressPackageStartupMessages(library(ComplexHeatmap))\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n#2. Source helpers\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nsource(file.path(rscript_dir, \"data_io.R\"))\nsource(file.path(rscript_dir, \"clustering.R\"))\nsource(file.path(rscript_dir, \"enrichment.R\"))\ncat(\"Helper scripts sourced.\\n\\n\")\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n#3. Read input data\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\ncat(\"Reading input data...\\n\")\nexpr_data <- load_expression_matrix(\n \"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/preprocessed_expression.csv\")\ncat(sprintf(\" Expression: %d x %d\\n\", nrow(expr_data), ncol(expr_data)))\n\nanno_raw <- read.csv(\"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/metabolites.csv\",\n stringsAsFactors = FALSE, check.names = FALSE)\nfeature_anno <- data.frame(\n ID = as.character(anno_raw$id),\n name = as.character(anno_raw$name),\n type = \"metabolite\",\n kegg = as.character(anno_raw$kegg),\n stringsAsFactors = FALSE)\n\ncommon_ids <- intersect(rownames(expr_data), feature_anno$ID)\nif (length(common_ids) ==0) {\n feature_anno <- data.frame(\n ID = as.character(anno_raw$name), name = as.character(anno_raw$name),\n type = \"metabolite\", kegg = as.character(anno_raw$kegg),\n stringsAsFactors = FALSE)\n common_ids <- intersect(rownames(expr_data), feature_anno$ID)\n}\nexpr_data <- expr_data[common_ids, , drop = FALSE]\nfeature_anno <- feature_anno[match(common_ids, feature_anno$ID), , drop = FALSE]\ncat(sprintf(\" After ID matching: %d metabolites\\n\", nrow(expr_data)))\n\nsample_groups <- data.frame(\n Sample = colnames(expr_data),\n Group = factor(ifelse(grepl(\"^Fc16YH_CD\", colnames(expr_data)), \"CD\",\n ifelse(grepl(\"^Fc16YH_FE\", colnames(expr_data)), \"FE\", \"NC\")),\n levels = c(\"NC\", \"CD\", \"FE\")),\n stringsAsFactors = FALSE)\ncat(\" Groups:\", paste(names(table(sample_groups$Group)), table(sample_groups$Group)), \"\\n\")\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n#4. Row-wise z-score normalization\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\ncat(\"\\nZ-score normalization...\\n\")\nexpr_z <- t(scale(t(expr_data)))\nna_rows <- rowSums(is.na(expr_z)) >0\nif (sum(na_rows) >0) {\n expr_z <- expr_z[!na_rows, , drop = FALSE]\n expr_data <- expr_data[!na_rows, , drop = FALSE]\n feature_anno <- feature_anno[!na_rows, , drop = FALSE]\n cat(sprintf(\" Removed %d NA rows.\\n\", sum(na_rows)))\n}\ncat(sprintf(\" Final: %d x %d\\n\", nrow(expr_z), ncol(expr_z)))\nstopifnot(nrow(expr_z) >=10)\n\n# ============================================================================\n# STEP1: Optimal Cluster Number\n# ============================================================================\ncat(\"\\n========== STEP1: Optimal k ==========\\n\")\n\nk_range <-2:15\nval <- data.frame(k = k_range, FPC = NA, PE = NA, Sil = NA)\n\nfor (k in k_range) {\n set.seed(42)\n res <- e1071::cmeans(expr_z, centers = k, m =2, iter.max =100)\n mem <- res$membership; n <- nrow(expr_z)\n fpc <- sum(mem^2)\/n\n pe <- -sum(mem * log(mem +1e-15))\/n\n hc <- res$cluster\n sil <- tryCatch(mean(cluster::silhouette(hc, dist(expr_z))[,3]), error=function(e) NA)\n val$FPC[val$k==k] <- fpc; val$PE[val$k==k] <- pe; val$Sil[val$k==k] <- sil\n cat(sprintf(\" k=%2d FPC=%.4f PE=%.4f Sil=%.4f\\n\", k, fpc, pe, sil))\n}\n\n# Elbow in FPC (k >=3)\ndiffs <- abs(diff(val$FPC))\ndiffs_norm <- diffs \/ max(diffs)\nelbow_k <- k_range[which(diffs_norm <0.45)[1] +1]\nif (is.na(elbow_k) || elbow_k <3) elbow_k <-6\n\n# Silhouette best among k>=3\nsil_sub <- val$Sil[val$k >=3]; k_sub <- val$k[val$k >=3]\nsil_best <- k_sub[which.max(sil_sub)]\n\n# Combined\ncandidates <- k_range[k_range >=3 & k_range <=10]\nc_sil <- val$Sil[match(candidates, k_range)]\nc_elbow <-1 - abs(candidates - elbow_k)\/max(1, max(candidates)-min(candidates))\nc_sil_n <- (c_sil - min(c_sil, na.rm=TRUE))\/max(1, max(c_sil,na.rm=TRUE)-min(c_sil,na.rm=TRUE))\noptimal_k <- candidates[which.max(0.6*c_sil_n +0.4*c_elbow)]\n\ncat(sprintf(\" Elbow k=%d, Sil-best k=%d, Final k=%d\\n\", elbow_k, sil_best, optimal_k))\n\nwrite.csv(val, file.path(work_dir, \"cmeans_validation_metrics.csv\"), row.names=FALSE)\n\n# Plot\nml <- rbind(data.frame(k=val$k, v=val$FPC, M=\"FPC (higher is better)\"),\n data.frame(k=val$k, v=val$PE, M=\"PE (lower is better)\"),\n data.frame(k=val$k, v=val$Sil, M=\"Avg Silhouette (higher is better)\"))\np_met <- ggplot(ml, aes(k, v)) + geom_line(color=\"steelblue\", linewidth=0.8) +\n geom_point(color=\"steelblue\", size=2) +\n geom_point(data=subset(ml, k==optimal_k), color=\"red\", size=3) +\n facet_wrap(~M, scales=\"free_y\", ncol=1) + scale_x_continuous(breaks=k_range) +\n labs(title=\"Cluster Validation Metrics\", subtitle=paste0(\"Optimal k = \", optimal_k),\n x=\"k\", y=\"Value\") + theme_bw(base_size=12) +\n theme(plot.title=element_text(hjust=0.5,face=\"bold\"),\n plot.subtitle=element_text(hjust=0.5,color=\"red\"),\n strip.text=element_text(face=\"bold\"), panel.grid.minor=element_blank())\nggsave(file.path(fig_dir, \"CMeans_validation_metrics.pdf\"), p_met, width=8, height=8)\nggsave(file.path(fig_dir, \"CMeans_validation_metrics.png\"), p_met, width=8, height=8, dpi=300)\ncat(\" Validation plot saved.\\n\")\n\n# ============================================================================\n# STEP2: CMeans Clustering\n# ============================================================================\ncat(\"\\n========== STEP2: CMeans k =\", optimal_k, \"==========\\n\")\n\nset.seed(42)\ncres <- e1071::cmeans(expr_z, centers = optimal_k, m =2, iter.max =100)\n\n# Renumber clusters sequentially (cmeans may produce gaps)\nunique_clusters <- sort(unique(cres$cluster))\ncluster_map <- setNames(seq_along(unique_clusters), unique_clusters)\ncluster_labels <- cluster_map[as.character(cres$cluster)]\nnames(cluster_labels) <- names(cres$cluster)\nmembership_mat <- cres$membership\ncenters_mat <- cres$centers\n\n# Reorder columns of membership to match new cluster numbers\ncolnames(membership_mat) <- cluster_map[as.character(unique_clusters)]\n# Reorder centers rows\nrownames(centers_mat) <- cluster_map[as.character(unique_clusters)]\ncenters_mat <- centers_mat[order(as.numeric(rownames(centers_mat))), , drop = FALSE]\nmembership_mat <- membership_mat[, order(as.numeric(colnames(membership_mat))), drop = FALSE]\n\ncat(\" Cluster sizes:\\n\"); print(table(cluster_labels))\ncat(sprintf(\" Converged: %s in %d iter\\n\", cres$converged, cres$iter))\n\nsaveRDS(list(cluster=cluster_labels, membership=membership_mat,\n centers=centers_mat, iter=cres$iter, converged=cres$converged,\n optimal_k=optimal_k, validation=val),\n file.path(work_dir, \"cmeans_result.rds\"))\n\ncluster_df <- data.frame(Metabolite=names(cluster_labels),\n Cluster=cluster_labels, MaxMembership=apply(membership_mat,1,max),\n stringsAsFactors=FALSE)\nwrite.csv(cluster_df, file.path(work_dir, \"cmeans_cluster_assignments.csv\"), row.names=FALSE)\n\n# ---2a. Profile plots ---\ncat(\" Generating profile plots...\\n\")\nsamp_order <- c()\nfor (g in c(\"NC\",\"CD\",\"FE\")) samp_order <- c(samp_order, sample_groups$Sample[sample_groups$Group==g])\ngrp_map <- setNames(as.character(sample_groups$Group), sample_groups$Sample)\n\nplot_list <- list()\nfor (k in seq_len(optimal_k)) {\n mems <- names(cluster_labels)[cluster_labels == k]\n if (length(mems)==0) next\n esub <- expr_z[mems, , drop=FALSE]\n elong <- melt(esub); colnames(elong) <- c(\"Metabolite\",\"Sample\",\"Expression\")\n elong$Cluster <- paste0(\"Cluster \", k)\n elong$Membership <- membership_mat[mems[elong$Metabolite], k]\n \n ctr <- data.frame(Metabolite=\"Center\", Sample=colnames(expr_z),\n Expression=as.numeric(centers_mat[k,]), Cluster=paste0(\"Cluster \",k),\n Membership=1, stringsAsFactors=FALSE)\n pdata <- rbind(elong, ctr)\n pdata$Sample <- factor(pdata$Sample, levels=samp_order)\n \n feat <- subset(pdata, Metabolite!=\"Center\")\n center_pt <- subset(pdata, Metabolite==\"Center\")\n \n p <- ggplot() +\n geom_line(data=feat, aes(x=Sample, y=Expression, group=Metabolite, color=Membership),\n alpha=0.25, linewidth=0.3) +\n geom_line(data=center_pt, aes(x=Sample, y=Expression, group=1),\n color=\"black\", linewidth=1.5) +\n scale_color_gradient(low=\"grey80\", high=\"darkred\", limits=c(0,1)) +\n labs(title=paste0(\"Cluster \", k, \" (n=\", length(mems), \")\"),\n x=\"Sample\", y=\"z-score Expression\", color=\"Membership\") +\n theme_bw(base_size=10) +\n theme(plot.title=element_text(hjust=0.5,face=\"bold\",size=11),\n axis.text.x=element_text(angle=45,hjust=1,size=7), legend.position=\"right\")\n plot_list[[k]] <- p\n}\n\nnc <- if(optimal_k<=4)2 else if(optimal_k<=6)3 else4\nnr <- ceiling(optimal_k\/nc)\npp <- gridExtra::marrangeGrob(plot_list, nrow=nr, ncol=nc, top=NULL)\nggsave(file.path(fig_dir, \"CMeans_profiles.pdf\"), pp, width=4*nc, height=3.5*nr)\nggsave(file.path(fig_dir, \"CMeans_profiles.png\"), pp, width=4*nc, height=3.5*nr, dpi=300)\ncat(\" Profile plots saved.\\n\")\n\n# ---2b. Membership heatmap ---\ncat(\" Generating membership heatmap...\\n\")\nord <- order(cluster_labels, -apply(membership_mat,1,max))\nmo <- membership_mat[ord, ]; colnames(mo) <- paste0(\"C\", seq_len(optimal_k))\nra <- data.frame(Cluster=factor(cluster_labels[ord], levels=seq_len(optimal_k)),\n row.names=rownames(mo))\ncc <- setNames(brewer.pal(max(optimal_k,3),\"Set2\")[seq_len(optimal_k)],\n as.character(seq_len(optimal_k)))\nca <- data.frame(Group=sample_groups$Group, row.names=sample_groups$Sample)\ngc <- c(NC=\"#4DBBD5\", CD=\"#E64B35\", FE=\"#00A087\")\nmcf <- circlize::colorRamp2(c(0,0.5,1), c(\"white\",\"orange\",\"darkred\"))\nhr <- rowAnnotation(Cluster=ra$Cluster, col=list(Cluster=cc), show_annotation_name=FALSE)\nhc <- HeatmapAnnotation(Group=ca$Group, col=list(Group=gc), show_annotation_name=FALSE)\n\npdf(file.path(fig_dir, \"CMeans_membership_heatmap.pdf\"), width=10, height=max(5,optimal_k*0.8+2))\nht <- Heatmap(t(mo), name=\"Membership\", col=mcf, top_annotation=hc,\n right_annotation=hr, show_row_names=TRUE, show_column_names=FALSE,\n row_names_gp=gpar(fontsize=9), cluster_rows=TRUE, cluster_columns=FALSE,\n column_split=ra$Cluster, column_title_gp=gpar(fontsize=8),\n heatmap_legend_param=list(direction=\"vertical\"))\ndraw(ht); dev.off()\npng(file.path(fig_dir, \"CMeans_membership_heatmap.png\"), width=3000, height=max(1500,optimal_k*240+600), res=300)\ndraw(ht); dev.off()\ncat(\" Membership heatmap saved.\\n\")\n\n# ============================================================================\n# STEP3: KEGG Enrichment & WGCNA\n# ============================================================================\ncat(\"\\n========== STEP3: KEGG & WGCNA ==========\\n\")\n\n# ---3a. KEGG enrichment ---\ncat(\"\\n3a. KEGG enrichment...\\n\")\nall_feat <- rownames(expr_z)\nkegg_res <- list()\n\nfor (k in seq_len(optimal_k)) {\n sig <- names(cluster_labels)[cluster_labels == k]\n cat(sprintf(\" Cluster %d: %d metabolites\\n\", k, length(sig)))\n if (length(sig)<3) { cat(\" Too few.\\n\"); next }\n \n er <- tryCatch(perform_fisher_enrichment(all_feat, sig, feature_anno, \"kegg\",\n pvalue_threshold=1, p_adjust_method=\"BH\"),\n error=function(e){cat(\" Error:\",conditionMessage(e),\"\\n\"); data.frame()})\n \n if (nrow(er)>0) {\n er$Cluster <- paste0(\"Cluster\", k)\n kegg_res[[k]] <- er\n ns <- sum(er$enriched)\n if (ns>0) cat(sprintf(\" %d enriched\\n\", ns)) else\n cat(sprintf(\" Top: %s (p=%.4f)\\n\", er$Category[1], er$pvalue[1]))\n }\n}\n\nif (length(kegg_res)>0) {\n ec <- do.call(rbind, kegg_res)\n write.csv(ec, file.path(work_dir, \"cmeans_cluster_kegg_enrichment.csv\"), row.names=FALSE)\n cat(\" Enrichment saved.\\n\")\n \n tl <- lapply(kegg_res, function(d) if(nrow(d)>0) head(d[order(d$pvalue),],5) else NULL)\n te <- do.call(rbind, tl[!sapply(tl,is.null)])\n if (nrow(te)>0 && length(unique(te$Cluster))>0) {\n te$nlog <- -log10(te$pvalue)\n te$cat_short <- substr(te$Category,1,60)\n pe <- ggplot(te, aes(x=reorder(cat_short,Count_in_sig), y=Count_in_sig, fill=nlog)) +\n geom_bar(stat=\"identity\") + coord_flip() +\n facet_wrap(~Cluster, scales=\"free_y\", ncol=2) +\n scale_fill_gradient(low=\"lightblue\", high=\"darkred\", name=expression(-log[10](P))) +\n labs(title=\"KEGG Enrichment by CMeans Cluster\", x=\"Pathway\", y=\"Count\") +\n theme_bw(base_size=11) +\n theme(plot.title=element_text(hjust=0.5,face=\"bold\"),\n strip.text=element_text(face=\"bold\"), axis.text.y=element_text(size=8))\n ggsave(file.path(fig_dir,\"CMeans_cluster_kegg_enrichment.pdf\"), pe,\n width=12, height=max(6,3*length(unique(te$Cluster))))\n ggsave(file.path(fig_dir,\"CMeans_cluster_kegg_enrichment.png\"), pe,\n width=12, height=max(6,3*length(unique(te$Cluster))), dpi=300)\n cat(\" Enrichment plot saved.\\n\")\n }\n} else {\n write.csv(data.frame(), file.path(work_dir, \"cmeans_cluster_kegg_enrichment.csv\"))\n}\n\n# ---3b. WGCNA comparison ---\ncat(\"\\n3b. WGCNA comparison...\\n\")\nload_wgcna <- function(f) {\n if (!file.exists(f)) return(NULL)\n e <- new.env(); load(f, envir=e)\n for (vn in c(\"mergedColors\",\"moduleColors\",\"dynamicColors\"))\n if (exists(vn, envir=e)) return(get(vn, envir=e))\n if (exists(\"net\", envir=e) && !is.null(e$net$colors)) return(e$net$colors)\n NULL\n}\nmc <- load_wgcna(\"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/6_wgcna_trait_association_analysis\/wgcna_step2_data.RData\")\nif (is.null(mc))\n mc <- load_wgcna(\"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/6_wgcna_trait_association_analysis\/wgcna_step1_data.RData\")\n\nfound_wgcna <- !is.null(mc)\nif (found_wgcna) {\n cat(\" WGCNA data loaded.\\n\")\n cm <- intersect(all_feat, names(mc))\n cat(sprintf(\" Common metabolites: %d\\n\", length(cm)))\n \n if (length(cm)>=10) {\n uc <- unique(mc[cm])\n cn <- ifelse(uc==\"grey\",\"Grey\",paste0(toupper(substr(uc,1,1)),substr(uc,2,nchar(uc))))\n names(cn) <- uc\n cl <- cluster_labels[cm]; wm <- cn[mc[cm]]\n ct <- table(CMeans=cl, WGCNA=wm)\n cat(\" Contingency:\\n\"); print(ct)\n write.csv(as.data.frame.matrix(ct), file.path(work_dir,\"cmeans_vs_wgcna_contingency.csv\"))\n \n fg <- tryCatch(fisher.test(ct, simulate.p.value=TRUE, B=10000),\n error=function(e) list(p.value=NA))\n cat(sprintf(\" Fisher p = %s\\n\", ifelse(is.na(fg$p.value),\"NA\",format(fg$p.value,digits=4))))\n \n fp <- data.frame()\n for (ci in rownames(ct)) for (mj in colnames(ct)) {\n a <- ct[ci,mj]; b <- sum(ct[ci,])-a; c <- sum(ct[,mj])-a; d <- sum(ct)-a-b-c\n if (a>0) {\n ft <- fisher.test(matrix(c(a,b,c,d),2), alternative=\"greater\")\n ex <- sum(ct[ci,])*sum(ct[,mj])\/sum(ct)\n fp <- rbind(fp, data.frame(CMeans=ci, WGCNA=mj, Count=a,\n Expected=round(ex,1), Fold=round(a\/max(1,ex),2),\n p=ft$p.value, stringsAsFactors=FALSE))\n }\n }\n if (nrow(fp)>0) {\n fp$p_adj <- p.adjust(fp$p, \"BH\"); fp <- fp[order(fp$p),]\n write.csv(fp, file.path(work_dir,\"cmeans_vs_wgcna_fisher.csv\"), row.names=FALSE)\n cat(\" Pairwise Fisher results saved.\\n\")\n }\n \n # Stacked bar plot\n fd <- as.data.frame(ct); colnames(fd) <- c(\"CMeans\",\"WGCNA\",\"Count\")\n um <- unique(fd$WGCNA)\n mcols <- setNames(c(brewer.pal(12,\"Set3\"),\"grey60\")[seq_along(um)], um)\n pb <- ggplot(fd, aes(x=CMeans, y=Count, fill=WGCNA)) +\n geom_bar(stat=\"identity\", position=\"fill\") + scale_fill_manual(values=mcols) +\n labs(title=\"CMeans vs WGCNA Modules (Proportion)\", x=\"CMeans\", y=\"Proportion\",\n fill=\"WGCNA Module\") + theme_bw(base_size=12) +\n theme(plot.title=element_text(hjust=0.5,face=\"bold\"), legend.position=\"bottom\") +\n guides(fill=guide_legend(nrow=2))\n ggsave(file.path(fig_dir,\"CMeans_vs_WGCNA_proportion.pdf\"), pb, width=9, height=6)\n ggsave(file.path(fig_dir,\"CMeans_vs_WGCNA_proportion.png\"), pb, width=9, height=6, dpi=300)\n cat(\" Comparison plot saved.\\n\")\n }\n} else {\n cat(\" WGCNA data not found.\\n\")\n write.csv(data.frame(), file.path(work_dir,\"cmeans_vs_wgcna_contingency.csv\"))\n write.csv(data.frame(), file.path(work_dir,\"cmeans_vs_wgcna_fisher.csv\"))\n}\n\n# ============================================================================\n# Summary\n# ============================================================================\ncat(\"\\n========================================\\n\")\ncat(\"CMeans Analysis Complete\\n\")\ncat(\"========================================\\n\")\ncat(sprintf(\" Optimal k : %d\\n\", optimal_k))\ncat(sprintf(\" Clusters : %d\\n\", length(unique(cluster_labels))))\ncat(sprintf(\" Metabolites : %d\\n\", nrow(expr_z)))\ncat(sprintf(\" WGCNA compare : %s\\n\", ifelse(found_wgcna,\"Yes\",\"Skipped\")))\ncat(sprintf(\" Work dir : %s\\n\", work_dir))\ncat(sprintf(\" Figure dir : %s\\n\\n\", fig_dir))\n\nfor (f in list.files(work_dir, pattern=\"\\\\.(csv|rds)$\"))\n cat(sprintf(\" %s\\n\", file.path(work_dir, f)))\nfor (f in list.files(fig_dir, pattern=\"\\\\.(pdf|png)$\"))\n cat(sprintf(\" %s\\n\", file.path(fig_dir, f)))\ncat(\"\\nDone.\\n\")\n","path":"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\/scripts\/run_cmeans.R"},"FunctionName":"write_file","Id":"call_00_HPLaDnOjT2O6AhMIGYOe2417"}]}
