{"Content":"{\"exit_code\": 0, \"stdout\": \"========================================\\r\\nStep3: KEGG Enrichment & WGCNA Comparison\\r\\n========================================\\r\\n\\r\\nPackages & helpers ready.\\r\\n\\r\\nCMeans result loaded: 2059 metabolites, 4 clusters\\r\\nCluster sizes:\\r\\ncluster_labels\\r\\n  1   2   3   4 \\r\\n496 455 524 584 \\r\\nExpression matrix loaded: 2059 total features\\r\\nMatched 2059 metabolites with annotation\\r\\n\\r\\n==========4a. KEGG Enrichment (Fisher test) ==========\\r\\n Cluster 1: 496 metabolites\\r\\n 1 enriched pathways (p.adj<0.05)\\r\\n Cluster 2: 455 metabolites\\r\\n 214 enriched pathways (p.adj<0.05)\\r\\n Cluster 3: 524 metabolites\\r\\n 272 enriched pathways (p.adj<0.05)\\r\\n Cluster 4: 584 metabolites\\r\\n Top pathway: NULL (p=0.0437)\\r\\n Combined enrichment saved: 3832 rows\\r\\n Enrichment barplot saved.\\r\\n\\r\\n==========5. WGCNA Module Comparison ==========\\r\\n WGCNA module colors NOT found in RData files.\\r\\n Checked: wgcna_step1_data.RData and wgcna_step2_data.RData\\r\\n Writing empty comparison files.\\r\\n\\r\\n========================================\\r\\nStep3 Complete\\r\\n========================================\\r\\n CMeans clusters : 4\\r\\n KEGG enrichment results : Yes\\r\\n WGCNA modules found : Not found\\r\\n WGCNA contingency : Yes\\r\\n Work dir : G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\\r\\n Figure dir : G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/analysis\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\/figures\\r\\n\\r\\nOutput files:\\r\\n G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\/cmeans_cluster_assignments.csv\\r\\n G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\/cmeans_cluster_kegg_enrichment.csv\\r\\n G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\/cmeans_validation_metrics.csv\\r\\n G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/7_cmean