{"Content":"Excellent! The WGCNA comparison now works perfectly and reveals very strong concordance between the two methods. Let me update the result summary.","Role":"assistant","ToolCallId":null,"ToolCalls":[{"DeepSeekDSMLLeak":false,"FunctionArguments":{"content":"{\n \"module_name\": \"7. CMeans Fuzzy Clustering Analysis\",\n \"goal\": \"对预处理后的代谢组学表达矩阵执行CMeans模糊聚类，识别代谢物模糊分组，进行KEGG富集分析，并与WGCNA模块交叉验证\",\n \"status\": \"completed\",\n \"steps\": {\n \"step1_optimal_k\": {\n \"optimal_k\":6,\n \"actual_clusters\":4,\n \"method\": \"Elbow (FPC) + Silhouette combined score\",\n \"note\": \"k=6 requested;2 centroids collapsed →4 non-empty clusters\"\n },\n \"step2_clustering_visualization\": {\n \"cluster_sizes\": {\"Cluster1\":496, \"Cluster2\":455, \"Cluster3\":524, \"Cluster4\":584},\n \"total_metabolites\":2059,\n \"figures_generated\": [\n \"CMeans_validation_metrics.pdf\/png\",\n \"CMeans_profiles.pdf\/png\",\n \"CMeans_membership_heatmap.pdf\/png\"\n ]\n },\n \"step3a_kegg_enrichment\": {\n \"cluster1\": \"1 enriched pathway (p.adj<0.05)\",\n \"cluster2\": \"214 enriched pathways\",\n \"cluster3\": \"272 enriched pathways\",\n \"cluster4\": \"No significant enrichment (top: NULL, p=0.0437)\",\n \"total_enrichment_rows\":3832,\n \"figure\": \"CMeans_cluster_kegg_enrichment.pdf\/png\"\n },\n \"step3b_wgcna_comparison\": {\n \"overlap_metabolites\":2059,\n \"wgcna_modules\":6,\n \"global_fisher_p\": \"9.999e-05\",\n \"significant_pairwise\":7,\n \"key_alignments\": [\n {\"CMeans_Cluster1\": \"WGCNA Turquoise (100%, Fold=3.82, p≈0)\"},\n {\"CMeans_Cluster2\": \"WGCNA Magenta (60%, Fold=4.46, p≈0) + Red (15%, Fold=2.61, p<1e-17)\"},\n {\"CMeans_Cluster3\": \"WGCNA Blue (90%, Fold=3.61, p≈0) + Red (9%, Fold=1.66, p<0.0001)\"},\n {\"CMeans_Cluster4\": \"WGCNA Black (87%, Fold=3.07, p≈0) + Purple (5%, Fold=2.67, p<1e-8)\"}\n ],\n \"figures\": [\n \"CMeans_vs_WGCNA_proportion.pdf\/png\",\n \"CMeans_vs_WGCNA_alluvial.pdf\/png\"\n ]\n }\n },\n \"biological_interpretation\": \"CMeans聚类与WGCNA模块高度一致（Global Fisher p<0.0001）。Cluster1（FE组标志）100%对应Turquoise模块（FE组相关），Cluster3对应Blue模块（NC\/健康标志），Cluster4对应Black模块，Cluster2对应Magenta(CD组标志)+Red模块。两种方法从不同角度（硬聚类vs软聚类）揭示了相同的代谢物分组结构。\",\n \"output_files\": {\n \"work_dir\": \"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\",\n \"figures_dir\": \"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/analysis\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\/figures\",\n \"csv_files\": [\n \"cmeans_cluster_assignments.csv\",\n \"cmeans_validation_metrics.csv\",\n \"cmeans_cluster_kegg_enrichment.csv\",\n \"cmeans_vs_wgcna_contingency.csv\",\n \"cmeans_vs_wgcna_fisher.csv\"\n ],\n \"rds_file\": [\"cmeans_result.rds\"],\n \"figure_files\": [\n \"CMeans_validation_metrics.pdf\/png\",\n \"CMeans_profiles.pdf\/png\",\n \"CMeans_membership_heatmap.pdf\/png\",\n \"CMeans_cluster_kegg_enrichment.pdf\/png\",\n \"CMeans_vs_WGCNA_proportion.pdf\/png\",\n \"CMeans_vs_WGCNA_alluvial.pdf\/png\"\n ]\n },\n \"notes\": \"1. Optimal k=6但仅形成4个非空簇。2. KEGG富集显示Cluster2和3分别有214和272个富集通路，具有显著生物学意义。3. CMeans与WGCNA高度一致（Fisher p<0.0001），验证了两种聚类方法的互补性和可靠性。4. WGCNA数据从wgcna_step2_data.RData的module_df变量读取。\"\n}\n","path":"G:\/OmicsWorks\/test\/metabolism\/demo\/tmp\/7_cmeans_fuzzy_clustering_analysis\/result.json"},"FunctionName":"write_file","Id":"call_00_Pqb4KI7lkxYperi9SsQJ5089"}]}
